  "contentHtml": "<p>선생님 안녕하세요!</p><p>1단원 화학반응의 규칙 단원에서 실시했던 실험 수행평가지 공유합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>첫 실험 수업이었는데 학생들이 이것저것 해볼거리가 많아서 재미있어하는 수행이였네요~^^</p><p>간만에 실험복도 입혔더니 아이들이 설레어 해서 괜히 제가 뿌듯했다는....^^</p><p>다른 선생님들께서는 어떤 식으로 수업, 평가하시는지 궁금합니다~ 의견주세요!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f39c25ff972ce9c03ae5c2f652ddbe39b89224f5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f39c25ff972ce9c03ae5c2f652ddbe39b89224f5\" data-origin-width=\"756\" data-origin-height=\"340\"></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/373ff82f98bfd3cd03e254b5958b7fa97a67335f\" data-origin-width=\"651\" data-origin-height=\"918\" style=\"width:43.33%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/373ff82f98bfd3cd03e254b5958b7fa97a67335f\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68d07feddbf3a23f487207f7d54e3e6d99422050\" data-origin-width=\"691\" data-origin-height=\"745\" style=\"width:56.67%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68d07feddbf3a23f487207f7d54e3e6d99422050\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b90f0a0362f620460804b43a20da41e14e6720fb?download\" data-file-name=\"마그네슘의 변화 분석하기 수행평가.hwp\" data-file-size=\"81920\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D600%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20230325002200&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fb90f0a0362f620460804b43a20da41e14e6720fb')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">마그네슘의 변화 